<h2>Organizing web material — Hugging Face papers</h2>
<p>Give it a single URL and Claude Code fetches that page's contents and organizes them for you. In this exercise we organize the <strong>Hugging Face Daily Papers</strong> (the list of papers that got the most upvotes that day).</p>

<h3>How to ask</h3>
<pre><code><span class="c"># Paste the Daily Papers URL from huggingface.co</span>
https://huggingface.co/papers
<span class="c"># then follow with</span>
Organize today's papers.</code></pre>

<h3>It doesn't stop at the list page</h3>
